\q2 \w and no longer|strong="H03808"\w* \w waver|strong="H05110"\w*,
\q1 \v 2 \w and if you can swear|strong="H07650"\w*, ‘\w As surely as the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w lives|strong="H02416"\w*,’
