\q1 
\p \v 3 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w* \w to the men|strong="H00376"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w and Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*:
