\s1 Disaster from the North
\q1 
\p \v 5 \w Announce|strong="H05046"\w* \w in Judah|strong="H03063"\w*, \w proclaim|strong="H08085"\w* \w in Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*, \w and say|strong="H00559"\w*:
