\q1 ‘\w Assemble yourselves|strong="H00622"\w*
\q2 \w and let us flee|strong="H00935"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w the fortified|strong="H04013"\w* \w cities|strong="H05892"\w*.’
