\q1 \v 17 \w They surround her|strong="H05439"\w* \w like men guarding|strong="H08104"\w* \w a field|strong="H07704"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H01961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w*
\q2 \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w she has rebelled against Me|strong="H04784"\w*,” \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*.
\q1 \v 18 “\w Your ways|strong="H01870"\w* \w and deeds|strong="H04611"\w*
\q2 \w have brought|strong="H06213"\w* \w this|strong="H00428"\w* upon you.
