\q1 \v 21 \w How long|strong="H05704"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04970"\w* \w must I see|strong="H07200"\w* \w the signal flag|strong="H05251"\w*
\q2 \w and hear|strong="H08085"\w* \w the sound|strong="H06963"\w* \w of the horn|strong="H07782"\w*?
