\p \v 17 \w The LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w of Hosts|strong="H06635"\w*, \w who planted|strong="H05193"\w* \w you|strong="H00853"\w*, \w has decreed|strong="H01696"\w* \w disaster|strong="H07451"\w* \w against you|strong="H05921"\w* \w on account of|strong="H01558"\w* \w the evil that|strong="H07451"\w* \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w and the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w have brought upon themselves|strong="H06213"\w*, . . . \w provoking Me to anger|strong="H03707"\w* \w by burning incense|strong="H06999"\w* \w to Baal|strong="H01168"\w*.”
\s1 A Plot against Jeremiah
\r (Jeremiah 18:18–23)
\q1 \v 18 \w And the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w informed me|strong="H03045"\w*, \w so I knew|strong="H03045"\w*.
