\p \v 14 “\w The prophets|strong="H05030"\w* \w are prophesying|strong="H05012"\w* \w lies|strong="H08267"\w* \w in My name|strong="H08034"\w*,” \w replied|strong="H00559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*\w . . .|strong="H00413"\w*. “\w I did not|strong="H03808"\w* \w send them|strong="H07971"\w* \w [or]|strong="H03808"\w* \w appoint them|strong="H06680"\w* \w [or]|strong="H03808"\w* \w speak|strong="H01696"\w* \w to them|strong="H00413"\w*. \w They|strong="H01992"\w* \w are prophesying|strong="H05012"\w* to you \w a false|strong="H08267"\w* \w vision|strong="H02377"\w*, \w a worthless divination|strong="H07081"\w*, \w the futility|strong="H00434"\w* \w and delusion|strong="H08649"\w* \w of their own minds|strong="H03820"\w*.
