\c 15
\s1 Judgment to Continue
\p \v 1 \w Then the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w said|strong="H00559"\w* \w to me|strong="H00413"\w*: “\w Even if|strong="H00518"\w* \w Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w and Samuel|strong="H08050"\w* \w should stand|strong="H05975"\w* \w before Me|strong="H06440"\w*, \w My heart|strong="H05315"\w* \w would not|strong="H00369"\w* \w go out to|strong="H00413"\w* \w this|strong="H02088"\w* \w people|strong="H05971"\w*. \w Send them|strong="H07971"\w* \w from|strong="H05921"\w* \w My presence|strong="H06440"\w*, \w and let them go|strong="H03318"\w*! \v 2 \w -|strong="H01961"\w* \w If|strong="H03588"\w* \w they ask you|strong="H00559"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* ‘\w Where|strong="H00575"\w* \w shall we go|strong="H03318"\w*?’ \w you are to tell them|strong="H00559"\w* \w that|strong="H00413"\w* \w this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*:
