\q2 \w and those|strong="H00834"\w* \w destined for captivity|strong="H07628"\w*, \w to captivity|strong="H07628"\w*.’
\p \v 3 \w I will appoint|strong="H06485"\w* \w over them|strong="H05921"\w* \w four|strong="H00702"\w* \w kinds of destroyers|strong="H04940"\w*, \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*: \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the sword|strong="H02719"\w* \w to kill|strong="H02026"\w*, \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the dogs|strong="H03611"\w* \w to drag away|strong="H05498"\w*, \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and the birds|strong="H05775"\w* \w of the air|strong="H08064"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w and beasts|strong="H00929"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w to devour|strong="H00398"\w* \w and destroy|strong="H07843"\w*. \v 4 \w I will make them|strong="H05414"\w* \w a horror|strong="H02113"\w* \w to all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the kingdoms|strong="H04467"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w because of|strong="H01558"\w* \w what|strong="H00834"\w* \w Manasseh|strong="H04519"\w* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Hezekiah|strong="H02396"\w* \w king|strong="H04428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w -|strong="H05921"\w* \w did|strong="H06213"\w* \w in Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*.
