\p \v 12 \w But they will reply|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w It is hopeless|strong="H02976"\w*. \w . . .|strong="H03588"\w* \w We will follow|strong="H01980"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00310"\w* \w our own plans|strong="H04284"\w*, \w and each of us|strong="H00376"\w* \w will act|strong="H06213"\w* \w according to the stubbornness|strong="H08307"\w* \w of his evil|strong="H07451"\w* \w heart|strong="H03820"\w*.’”
\p \v 13 \w Therefore|strong="H03651"\w* \w this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*:
