\p \v 6 \w So|strong="H03651"\w* \w behold|strong="H02009"\w*, \w the days|strong="H03117"\w* \w are coming|strong="H00935"\w*, \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, \w when this|strong="H02088"\w* \w place|strong="H04725"\w* \w will no|strong="H03808"\w* \w longer|strong="H05750"\w* \w be called|strong="H07121"\w* \w Topheth|strong="H08612"\w* \w or the Valley|strong="H01516"\w* \w of Ben-hinnom|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02011"\w*, \w but|strong="H03588"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00518"\w* \w the Valley|strong="H01516"\w* \w of Slaughter|strong="H02028"\w*. \v 7 \w And in this|strong="H02088"\w* \w place|strong="H04725"\w* \w I will ruin|strong="H01238"\w*\f + \fr 19:7 \ft The Hebrew term for \fqa ruin \ft sounds like the Hebrew for \fqa jar\ft ; see verses 1 and 10.\f* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w the plans|strong="H06098"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w and Jerusalem|strong="H03389"\w*. \w I will make them fall|strong="H05307"\w* \w by the sword|strong="H02719"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w their enemies|strong="H00341"\w*, \w by the hands|strong="H03027"\w* \w of those who seek|strong="H01245"\w* \w their lives|strong="H05315"\w*, \w and I will give|strong="H05414"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w their carcasses|strong="H05038"\w* \w as food|strong="H03978"\w* \w to the birds|strong="H05775"\w* \w of the air|strong="H08064"\w* \w and the beasts|strong="H00929"\w* \w of the earth|strong="H00776"\w*.
