\s1 A Warning to Coniah
\p \v 24 “\w As surely as I|strong="H00589"\w* \w live|strong="H02416"\w*,” \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, “\w even|strong="H03588"\w*\w if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you, Coniah|strong="H03659"\w*\f + \fr 22:24 \fqa Coniah \ft is a variant of \fqa Jehoiachin\ft ; also in verse 28.\f* \w son|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Jehoiakim|strong="H03079"\w* \w king|strong="H04428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w*, \w were|strong="H01961"\w* \w a signet ring|strong="H02368"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w My right|strong="H03225"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03588"\w* \w hand|strong="H03027"\w*, \w I would pull you|strong="H05423"\w* \w off|strong="H08033"\w*. \v 25 \w In fact, I will hand you over|strong="H05414"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w to those|strong="H00834"\w* \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w dread|strong="H03016"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H06440"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w who want to take|strong="H01245"\w* \w your life|strong="H05315"\w* — \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w to Nebuchadnezzar|strong="H05019"\w* \w king|strong="H04428"\w* \w of Babylon|strong="H00894"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03027"\w* \w and to the Chaldeans|strong="H03778"\w*.\f + \fr 22:25 \ft That is, the Babylonians\f* \v 26 \w I will hurl|strong="H02904"\w* \w you|strong="H00853"\w* \w and|strong="H00853"\w* \w the mother|strong="H00517"\w* \w who|strong="H00834"\w* \w gave you birth|strong="H03205"\w* \w into|strong="H05921"\w* \w another|strong="H00312"\w* \w land|strong="H00776"\w*, \w where|strong="H00834"\w* \w neither|strong="H03808"\w* \w of you were born|strong="H03205"\w* — \w and there|strong="H08033"\w* \w . . .|strong="H08033"\w* \w you both will die|strong="H04191"\w*. \v 27 \w [You] will never|strong="H03808"\w* \w return|strong="H07725"\w* \w to|strong="H05921"\w* \w the land|strong="H00776"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w for which [you]|strong="H01992"\w* \w long|strong="H05375"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w -|strong="H05315"\w* \w . . .|strong="H07725"\w* \w . . .|st