\q1 \v 14 \w All|strong="H03605"\w* \w your lovers|strong="H00157"\w* \w have forgotten|strong="H07911"\w* \w you|strong="H00853"\w*;
\q2 \w they no longer|strong="H03808"\w* \w seek you|strong="H01875"\w*,
\q1 \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04347"\w* \w I have struck you|strong="H05221"\w* \w as an enemy would|strong="H00341"\w*,
\q2 \w with the discipline|strong="H04148"\w* \w of someone cruel|strong="H00394"\w*,
\q1 \w because of|strong="H05921"\w* \w your great|strong="H07230"\w* \w iniquity|strong="H05771"\w*
\q2 \w and your numerous|strong="H06105"\w* \w sins|strong="H02403"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 15 \w Why|strong="H04100"\w* \w do you cry out|strong="H02199"\w* \w over|strong="H05921"\w* \w your wound|strong="H07667"\w*?
\q2 \w Your pain|strong="H04341"\w* \w has no cure|strong="H00605"\w*!
\q1 \w Because of|strong="H05921"\w* \w your great|strong="H07230"\w* \w iniquity|strong="H05771"\w*
\q2 \w and your numerous|strong="H06105"\w* \w sins|strong="H02403"\w*
\q2 \w I have done|strong="H06213"\w* \w these things|strong="H00428"\w* to you.
\b 
\q1 \v 16 \w Nevertheless|strong="H03651"\w*, \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who devour you|strong="H00398"\w* \w will be devoured|strong="H00398"\w*,
\q2 \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w your adversaries|strong="H06862"\w*— \w every one of them|strong="H03605"\w*—
\q2 \w will go off|strong="H01980"\w* \w into exile|strong="H07628"\w*.
\q1 \w Those who plundered you|strong="H08155"\w* \w will be plundered|strong="H01961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H04933"\w*,
\q2 \w and all|strong="H03605"\w* \w who raided you|strong="H00962"\w* \w will be raided|strong="H05414"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00957"\w*.
\q1 \v 17 \w But|strong="H03588"\w* \w I will restore|strong="H05927"\w* \w your health|strong="H00724"\w* \w and heal|strong="H07495"\w* \w your wounds|strong="H04347"\w*,
\q2 \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*,
\q1 \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w they call|strong="H07121"\w* you \w an outcast|strong="H05080"\w*,
\q2 \w Zion|strong="H06726"\w*, \w for whom|strong="H01931"\w* \w no one|strong="H00369"\w* \w cares|strong="H01875"\w*.”
\b 
\q1 
\p \v 18 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w . . .|strong="H02005"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w I will restore|strong="H07725"\w* \w the fortunes of|strong="H07622"\w*\f + \fr 30:18 \ft Or \fqa restore from captivity\f* \w Jacob’s|strong="H03290"\w* \w tents|strong="H00168"\w*
\q2 \w and have compassion|strong="H07355"\w* \w on his dwellings|strong="H04908"\w*.
\q1 \w And the city|strong="H05892"\w* \w will be rebuilt|strong="H01129"\w* \w on her|strong="H05921"\w* \w own ruins|strong="H08510"\w*,
\q2 \w and the palace|strong="H00759"\w* \w will stand|strong="H03427"\w* \w in|strong="H05921"\w* \w its rightful place|strong="H04941"\w*.
