\q2 \w you will understand|strong="H00995"\w* this.
\c 31
\s1 Mourning Turned to Joy
\r (Matthew 2:16–18)
\p \v 1 “\w At that|strong="H01931"\w* \w time|strong="H06256"\w*,” \w declares|strong="H05002"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, “\w I will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w the God|strong="H00430"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the families|strong="H04940"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w and they|strong="H01992"\w* \w will be|strong="H01961"\w* My \w people|strong="H05971"\w*.”
\p \v 2 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w The people|strong="H05971"\w* \w who survived|strong="H08300"\w* \w the sword|strong="H02719"\w*
\q2 \w found|strong="H04672"\w* \w favor|strong="H02580"\w* \w in the wilderness|strong="H04057"\w*
\q2 \w when Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w went|strong="H01980"\w* \w to find rest|strong="H07280"\w*.”
\p \v 3 \w The LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w appeared|strong="H07200"\w* to us \w in the past, [saying]|strong="H07350"\w*:\f + \fr 31:3 \ft Or \fqa The LORD appeared to him from afar, saying\f*
\b 
\q1 “\w I have loved|strong="H00157"\w* \w you with an everlasting|strong="H05769"\w* \w love|strong="H00160"\w*;
\q2 \w therefore|strong="H05921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03651"\w* \w I have drawn you|strong="H04900"\w* \w with loving devotion|strong="H02617"\w*.
\q1 \v 4 \w Again|strong="H05750"\w* \w I will build you|strong="H01129"\w*, \w and you will be rebuilt|strong="H01129"\w*,
\q2 \w O Virgin|strong="H01330"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w*.
\q1 \w Again|strong="H05750"\w* \w you will take up|strong="H05710"\w* \w your tambourines|strong="H08596"\w*
\q2 \w and go out|strong="H03318"\w* \w in joyful|strong="H07832"\w* \w dancing|strong="H04234"\w*.
\q1 \v 5 \w Again|strong="H05750"\w* \w you will plant|strong="H05193"\w* \w vineyards|strong="H03754"\w* \w on the hills|strong="H02022"\w* \w of Samaria|strong="H08111"\w*;
\q2 \w the farmers|strong="H05193"\w* \w will plant|strong="H05193"\w* \w and enjoy the fruit|strong="H02490"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w there will be|strong="H03426"\w* \w a day|strong="H03117"\w* \w when watchmen|strong="H05341"\w* \w will call out|strong="H07121"\w*
\q2 \w on the hills|strong="H02022"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w*,
