\c 33
\s1 The Excellence of the Restored Nation
\p \v 1 \w While [Jeremiah]|strong="H01931"\w* \w was still|strong="H05750"\w* \w confined|strong="H06113"\w* \w in the courtyard|strong="H02691"\w* \w of the guard|strong="H04307"\w*, \w the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w came|strong="H01961"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w [him]|strong="H03414"\w* \w a second time|strong="H08145"\w* \w -|strong="H00559"\w*: \v 2 “\w Thus|strong="H03541"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w who made the earth|strong="H06213"\w*,\f + \fr 33:2 \ft LXX; Hebrew \fqa who made it\f* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w who formed|strong="H03335"\w* \w it|strong="H00853"\w* \w and established it|strong="H03559"\w*, \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w is His name|strong="H08034"\w*: \v 3 \w Call|strong="H07121"\w* \w to Me|strong="H00413"\w*, \w and I will answer|strong="H06030"\w* \w and show|strong="H05046"\w* you \w great|strong="H01419"\w* \w and unsearchable things|strong="H01219"\w* \w you do not|strong="H03808"\w* \w know|strong="H03045"\w*.
\p \v 4 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w this is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*, \w the God|strong="H00430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w says|strong="H00559"\w* \w about|strong="H05921"\w* \w the houses|strong="H01004"\w* \w of this|strong="H02063"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05921"\w* \w city|strong="H05892"\w* \w and the palaces|strong="H01004"\w* \w of the kings|strong="H04428"\w* \w of Judah|strong="H03063"\w* \w that have been torn down|strong="H05422"\w* \w for defense against|strong="H00413"\w* \w the siege ramps|strong="H05550"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00413"\w* \w and the sword|strong="H02719"\w*: \v 5 \w -|strong="H00854"\w* \w The Chaldeans|strong="H03778"\w* \w are coming|strong="H00935"\w* \w to fight|strong="H03898"\w*\f + \fr 33:5 \ft Or \fqa They are coming to fight the Chaldeans\ft ; that is, the Babylonians\f* \w and to fill [those places]|strong="H04390"\w* \w with|strong="H00854"\w* \w the corpses|strong="H06297"\w* \w of the men|strong="H00120"\w* \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w I will strike down|strong="H05221"\w* \w in My anger|strong="H00639"\w* \w and in My wrath|strong="H02534"\w*. \w -|strong="H00834"\w* \w I have hidden|strong="H05641"\w* \w My face|strong="H06440"\w* \w from this|strong="H02063"\w* \w city|strong="H05892"\w* \w because of|strong="H05921"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w its wickedness|strong="H07451"\w*.
