\q2 \w proclaim|strong="H08085"\w* \w it in Memphis|strong="H05297"\w*\f + \fr 46:14 \ft LXX; Hebrew \fqa Noph\ft ; also in verse 19\f* \w and Tahpanhes|strong="H08471"\w* \w -|strong="H00559"\w*:
