\q1 \v 22 \w Egypt will hiss|strong="H06963"\w* \w like a fleeing|strong="H01980"\w* \w serpent|strong="H05175"\w*,\f + \fr 46:22 \ft Hebrew \fqa nachash\ft ; translated in most cases as \fqa snake\f*
