\c 47
\s1 Judgment on the Philistines
\r (Zephaniah 2:4–7)
\p \v 1 \w This is the word|strong="H01697"\w* \w of the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w came|strong="H01961"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w Jeremiah|strong="H03414"\w* \w the prophet|strong="H05030"\w* \w about|strong="H00413"\w* \w the Philistines|strong="H06430"\w* \w before|strong="H02962"\w* \w Pharaoh|strong="H06547"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w struck down|strong="H05221"\w* \w Gaza|strong="H05804"\w*. \v 2 \w This is what|strong="H03541"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w says|strong="H00559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 “\w See how|strong="H02009"\w* \w the waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w are rising|strong="H05927"\w* \w from the north|strong="H06828"\w*
\q2 \w and becoming|strong="H01961"\w* \w an overflowing|strong="H07857"\w* \w torrent|strong="H05158"\w*.
